Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Translate each concept into a production route with material preparation, operations, finishing, assembly, and inspection. Identify outsourced steps and dependencies, reserve realistic capacity, and retain specialist approval requirements for consequential structural or safety questions.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
